      "writtenOn": "2024-03-04T10:02:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This came up as expensive while researching app startup latency on R11.\nhttps://docs.google.com/document/d/1Qdi7V4Eu4TufWa1dqdN0Fei8v97qJTVNbQYGylkcRQo/edit?tab\u003dt.0#heading\u003dh.yc1conrtnvig\n\nGranted, this only shows up on devices like R11 that are very CPU constrained.\nThe work in packBitList isn\u0027t a problem, but I did want to convert the expressions to be compile time constants so that the constant can be inlined in the code that I found to be slow on the app startup path.\n\nRewrote to keep things to simple fast boolean ops.\nPTAL.\n\nAlso, would you mind if I changed all the other `packBitList` expressions, for consistency?",
